-white font-semibold text-lg","children":"Message match failure is the most costly"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 space-y-3 text-[#9e9e9e] leading-relaxed text-sm","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"The visitor arrived from an ad with a specific promise. If the headline does not confirm that promise within 3 words, the visitor re-evaluates their click - and frequently exits. Most pages fail this check because ads are written separately from landing page copy, often by different people on different timelines."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded border border-[#c7ff2f]/20 bg-[#c7ff2f]/5 px-4 py-3","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#c7ff2f] mb-1","children":"Implication"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Ad copy and landing page H1 should share a keyword. The scent from click to headline must be unbroken. This is a workflow problem as much as a copy problem."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"border border-border rounded-lg overflow-hidden","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-[#0d1110] px-5 py-4 flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#c7ff2f]/10 border border-[#c7ff2f]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#c7ff2f] font-mono text-sm font-bold","children":"3"}],["$","div",null,{"children":["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-white font-semibold text-lg","children":"The most expensive pages are often the most broken"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 space-y-3 text-[#9e9e9e] leading-relaxed text-sm","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Pages receiving $5,000+/month in paid traffic have the same structural failure rates as pages receiving $500/month. Budget does not predict page quality. High ad spend often indicates the page has been patched with creative and audience optimization rather than fixed at the structural layer."}],"$L37"]}]]}]]}]]}]
1d:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 pb-3 border-b border-border","children":"Comparison to Industry Benchmarks"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-[#9e9e9e] leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Industry CRO benchmarks suggest average landing page conversion rates for cold paid traffic fall between 2% and 5%, with significant variance by industry, offer type, and traffic temperature. The median sits closer to 2–3%."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"This report does not claim that a particular audit score predicts conversion rate. The dataset records structural findings, not attributable revenue outcomes; above-fold clarity, message scent, and friction reduction remain diagnostic signals rather than a validated conversion-rate model."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-md border border-border bg-[#0d1110] p-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9e9e9e] mb-2","children":"Forward-looking note"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed","children":"This hypothesis will be tested as Nebula collects before/after outcome data from pages that implemented structural recommendations. Outcome data will be reported in subsequent editions of this research."}]]}]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 pb-3 border-b border-border","children":"What This Means for Founders"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5 text-[#9e9e9e] leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Before testing creative, audiences, or offers - audit the page structural layer. The structural defects documented in this report exist independently of copy quality, visual design, or traffic source. They represent a floor below which optimization cannot operate effectively."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["The structural defects are observable in the HTML. You can verify every finding yourself using browser developer tools, a mobile device, and the 9 signal definitions published at"," ",["$","$L18",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=content&utm_medium=organic-content","className":"text-[#c7ff2f] underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity","children":"nebulacomponents.com/audit"}],". No third-party tool is required to confirm the findings on your own page."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Fix structural defects first; then the traffic quality and creative questions become answerable. A page with multiple structural findings does not produce reliable signal on creative performance. The structural layer must be resolved before higher-order variables can be meaningfully tested."}]]}]]}]
